{"name": "Splash Divers", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Indulge in a carefree diving experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey of aquatic delight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No limits on air supply. Only the mesmerizing ocean, captivating marine wonders, and your moments of pure bliss lie ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"149\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/cf80461f0280b11c140bcc3b04d95a34.avif?t=1786039776\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wave goodbye to countdowns and health bars as you dive headfirst into the ocean with a splash! Immerse yourself at your own pace, bask in the play of sunlight through the water, and indulge yourself in the enchanting undersea realm. Explore freely, befriend sea turtles, track whales, and interact with lively schools of vibrant fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/267d520490e5371c0813d61bf3d497c0.poster.avif?t=1786039776\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/267d520490e5371c0813d61bf3d497c0.webm?t=1786039776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/267d520490e5371c0813d61bf3d497c0.mp4?t=1786039776\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"149\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/22165e8da74dd212fb9927f733ee9063.avif?t=1786039776\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ocean is a bustling hub of intriguing creatures. Press the shutter and seize the moments! Witness lobsters darting in reverse and crabs parading sideways... but beware the inky wrath of squids if you get too close! Encounter these marvelous neighbors, snap memorable scenes, expand your oceanic encyclopedia, and turn each dive into a trove of excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/49d73203f56182de1dbe688c81667b8a.poster.avif?t=1786039776\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/49d73203f56182de1dbe688c81667b8a.webm?t=1786039776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/49d73203f56182de1dbe688c81667b8a.mp4?t=1786039776\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"149\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/b9dc108c5753d1441ec0f6f9189691d2.avif?t=1786039776\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to photographing marine life, dive deeper to collect shells and conches hidden beneath the waves. Craft your unique dive journal using stickers gifted by locals. Record your enchanting undersea memories with beautiful shells, exquisite stickers, and vivid imagery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/358176834ac50727c4ad61a3f3d6c08f.poster.avif?t=1786039776\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/358176834ac50727c4ad61a3f3d6c08f.webm?t=1786039776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/358176834ac50727c4ad61a3f3d6c08f.mp4?t=1786039776\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"149\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/02d5d9b6132e9a6b00db8226e7850215.avif?t=1786039776\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect with your fellow divers! Coming together from all corners of the world, you unite in a shared passion for the sea. Dive together, exchange collections, join in bonfire celebrations, and uncover each other's stories... In Splash Divers (\u5657\u901a\uff01\u6f5c\u6c34\u65f6\u5149), your sole aim is to unwind completely and savor the laid-back island moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/ef7ce9ba61203c31a897cf378cafbc66.poster.avif?t=1786039776\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/ef7ce9ba61203c31a897cf378cafbc66.webm?t=1786039776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/extras/ef7ce9ba61203c31a897cf378cafbc66.mp4?t=1786039776\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Immerse yourself in an unforgettable diving vacation! Break free from the limits of air supply and dive into the beauty of the ocean and its incredible marine life. Build your own personalized ocean encyclopedia, make friends with a diverse cast of dive buddies, and savor these moments of leisure.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239660/bf14a007808d581b1604bae83c73e4d1a00e016d/header.jpg?t=1786039776", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Cozy", "Wholesome", "Relaxing", "Casual", "Cute", "Exploration"], "developers": "Tinymo GAMES", "publishers": "Tinymo GAMES", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4239660", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 March 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/JorGz5JgzyM", "first_seen": 1773273600.0}